{"seq":1,"slug":"risk-uncertainty-decisions","title":"风险与不确定性下的决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/individual-decision/risk-uncertainty-decisions","wordCount":1687,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"风险与不确定性下的决策\">风险与不确定性下的决策</h1><p>1952 年，法国经济学家莫里斯·阿莱在一次学术会议上，向在场的决策理论权威们出了一道题。他让大家在两组彩票中各选其一，然后指出：绝大多数人——包括那些刚刚还在捍卫期望效用理论的大师们——做出的选择，恰恰违背了该理论的核心公理。这就是著名的阿莱悖论。它没有立刻推翻期望效用理论，却像一根扎进去的刺，提醒人们：规范理论说人「应该」怎么选，和真实的人「实际」怎么选，是两回事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>研究「不知道结果会怎样」的决策，要先分清两种情境。<strong>风险</strong>指概率已知（掷一枚公平硬币正面概率 0.5）；<strong>不确定性</strong>（奈特式）指概率未知（明天某只新股涨的概率，没人说得清）。期望效用理论是处理风险决策的规范基准，前景理论是描述真人行为的主导替代品，而模糊厌恶则处理不确定性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[面对不确定结果] --&gt; B{概率已知?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是,风险| C[期望效用理论&lt;br/&gt;规范基准]&#10;    B --&gt;|否,奈特不确定性| D[模糊厌恶&lt;br/&gt;埃尔斯伯格悖论]&#10;    C --&gt; E[真人系统偏离]&#10;    E --&gt; F[阿莱悖论&lt;br/&gt;确定性效应]&#10;    E --&gt; G[损失厌恶]&#10;    E --&gt; H[概率权重失真]&#10;    F --&gt; I[前景理论&lt;br/&gt;描述性模型]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[面对不确定结果] --&gt; B{概率已知?}\n    B --&gt;|是,风险| C[期望效用理论&lt;br/&gt;规范基准]\n    B --&gt;|否,奈特不确定性| D[模糊厌恶&lt;br/&gt;埃尔斯伯格悖论]\n    C --&gt; E[真人系统偏离]\n    E --&gt; F[阿莱悖论&lt;br/&gt;确定性效应]\n    E --&gt; G[损失厌恶]\n    E --&gt; H[概率权重失真]\n    F --&gt; I[前景理论&lt;br/&gt;描述性模型]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>下表对比两套理论对风险决策的刻画：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>期望效用理论（EUT）</th>\n<th>前景理论（PT）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评价对象</td>\n<td>最终财富水平</td>\n<td>相对参照点的得失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率处理</td>\n<td>线性，按真实概率加权</td>\n<td>非线性概率权重函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险态度</td>\n<td>由效用函数曲率决定</td>\n<td>收益区凹、损失区凸（损失厌恶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性质</td>\n<td>规范性（理性应如此）</td>\n<td>描述性（真人实际如此）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键异象</td>\n<td>无法解释阿莱悖论</td>\n<td>专为解释异象而建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"期望效用理论-规范的基准\">期望效用理论：规范的基准</h2><p>期望效用理论由冯·诺依曼和摩根斯坦在 1944 年公理化，它说：一个理性人评价一个彩票时，应当对各结果的效用按其概率加权求和，并选择期望效用最高者。形式上，彩票 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 给出结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其期望效用为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EU(L) = \\sum_i p_i \\, u(x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>风险态度完全由效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的曲率决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 为凹函数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u&#x27;&#x27; &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）表示风险厌恶，凸函数表示风险偏好，线性表示风险中性。这套理论之所以强大，是因为它从几条看似无可争议的公理（完备性、传递性、连续性、独立性）严格推出。问题恰恰出在「独立性公理」上——阿莱悖论正是对它的反例。</p>\n<p>风险厌恶的程度常用阿罗–普拉特绝对风险厌恶系数刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(x) = -u&#x27;&#x27;(x)/u&#x27;(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个量在实验中如何被测量出来，涉及具体的引出机制（多重价目表、彩票选择列表），其细节集中放在<a href=\"preference-elicitation-anomalies\">偏好引出与决策异象</a>，本篇只用其结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前景理论-真人如何偏离\">前景理论：真人如何偏离</h2><p>卡尼曼与特沃斯基 1979 年提出的前景理论，是对期望效用理论最成功的描述性替代，也是卡尼曼 2002 年获诺奖的核心贡献。它在三处关键改写了 EUT。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>参照点依赖</strong>：人评价的不是最终财富，而是相对某个参照点（通常是现状）的得与失。同样是手握 100 万，从 200 万跌下来的人和从 50 万涨上去的人感受天差地别。其二，<strong>损失厌恶</strong>：损失带来的痛苦约是等额收益带来快乐的两倍多，价值函数在损失区比收益区陡峭。这解释了禀赋效应——人一旦拥有某物，要价就远高于买价。其三，<strong>概率权重失真</strong>：人高估小概率（所以买彩票、买保险），低估中高概率，决策权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的非线性函数。前景理论的价值表示为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\sum_i w(p_i)\\, v(x_i - r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是参照点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是 S 形价值函数。损失厌恶在互动情境里还会演化出更复杂的表现，比如在谈判与公平判断中，详见<a href=\"../games-markets/social-preferences-ultimatum-trust\">社会偏好</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性效应与阿莱悖论的解剖\">确定性效应与阿莱悖论的解剖</h2><p>阿莱悖论的精髓是「确定性效应」：人对「确定」赋予了超额的权重。一个典型版本是：多数人在「确定拿 3000」与「80% 概率拿 4000」之间选前者（尽管后者期望值 3200 更高），却在「25% 概率拿 3000」与「20% 概率拿 4000」之间选后者。可后一对其实就是前一对各乘以 0.25——按独立性公理，选择应当一致，但人偏偏反转了。</p>\n<p>前景理论用概率权重函数完美解释了这一点：从 0.8 到 1.0 的概率提升，因为触及了「确定」，被赋予了远超线性的权重；而从 0.20 到 0.25 的同等比例提升，在中段几乎不被在意。确定性效应不是孤立的怪癖，它和损失厌恶、概率权重一起，构成了真人系统性偏离理性的稳定图景——可被预测，才可被建模。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模糊厌恶-当概率本身未知\">模糊厌恶：当概率本身未知</h2><p>把概率从「已知」抽掉，进入奈特式不确定性，又冒出新的异象。埃尔斯伯格 1961 年的实验是经典：一个瓮里有 30 个红球，60 个或黄或黑（比例未知）。多数人愿赌「抽到红」（概率明确 1/3），而不愿赌「抽到黑」（概率模糊）；可换个问法，他们又愿赌「红或黄」却不愿赌「黑或黄」——两次选择自相矛盾，无论你心里给黑球估什么概率都解释不通。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[埃尔斯伯格瓮:&lt;br/&gt;30红 60黄或黑] --&gt; B[赌红 vs 赌黑]&#10;    B --&gt; C[多数选赌红&lt;br/&gt;偏好明确概率]&#10;    A --&gt; D[赌红或黄 vs 赌黑或黄]&#10;    D --&gt; E[多数选赌黑或黄&lt;br/&gt;偏好明确概率]&#10;    C --&gt; F[两次偏好不一致]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[模糊厌恶:&lt;br/&gt;人厌恶概率本身不确定]\">graph TD\n    A[埃尔斯伯格瓮:&lt;br/&gt;30红 60黄或黑] --&gt; B[赌红 vs 赌黑]\n    B --&gt; C[多数选赌红&lt;br/&gt;偏好明确概率]\n    A --&gt; D[赌红或黄 vs 赌黑或黄]\n    D --&gt; E[多数选赌黑或黄&lt;br/&gt;偏好明确概率]\n    C --&gt; F[两次偏好不一致]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[模糊厌恶:&lt;br/&gt;人厌恶概率本身不确定]</pre><p>这就是模糊厌恶：人不仅厌恶风险，还厌恶「连概率都说不清」这件事本身。它解释了为什么投资者偏好熟悉的本土资产、为什么新产品推广艰难。处理模糊厌恶的理论（如最大最小期望效用、平滑模糊模型）放宽了单一概率分布的假设，是决策理论的活跃前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风险（概率已知）与奈特式不确定性（概率未知）是两类不同情境，对应不同理论。</li>\n<li>期望效用理论是规范基准，风险态度由效用函数曲率决定，但其独立性公理被阿莱悖论证伪。</li>\n<li>前景理论以参照点依赖、损失厌恶、概率权重失真三大改写，成功描述真人行为。</li>\n<li>确定性效应——对「确定」赋予超额权重——是阿莱悖论的核心，被概率权重函数解释。</li>\n<li>模糊厌恶表明人还厌恶概率本身的不确定，埃尔斯伯格悖论是其经典证据。</li>\n<li>风险态度的具体测量机制见<a href=\"preference-elicitation-anomalies\">偏好引出与决策异象</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风险与不确定性下的决策","id":"风险与不确定性下的决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"期望效用理论：规范的基准","id":"期望效用理论-规范的基准"},{"level":2,"text":"前景理论：真人如何偏离","id":"前景理论-真人如何偏离"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性效应与阿莱悖论的解剖","id":"确定性效应与阿莱悖论的解剖"},{"level":2,"text":"模糊厌恶：当概率本身未知","id":"模糊厌恶-当概率本身未知"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实验室、田野与自然实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/methodology/lab-field-natural-experiments"},"next":{"title":"时间偏好与跨期选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/individual-decision/time-preference-intertemporal"}}